<section><h2>Comparação entre períodos</h2><p>${u(e.period.label)} · período anterior: ${C(e.comparison.period.previous.start)} a ${C(e.comparison.period.previous.end)}</p><table><thead><tr><th>Métrica</th><th>Anterior</th><th>Atual</th><th>Variação</th></tr></thead><tbody>${Object.entries(e.comparison.metrics).map(([t,r])=>`<tr><td>${u(st[t]||t)}</td><td>${fn(t,r.previous)}</td><td>${fn(t,r.current)}</td><td>${t==="accuracy"&&e.comparisonInsights?.confidence!=="moderate"?"Amostra insuficiente":r.delta==null?"Dados insuficientes":t==="accuracy"?`${r.delta>0?"+":""}${r.delta} p.p.`:t==="minutes"?`${r.delta>0?"+":"−"}${Math.floor(Math.abs(r.delta)/60)}h ${String(Math.abs(r.delta)%60).padStart(2,"0")}min`:`${r.delta>0?"+":""}${r.delta}`}</td></tr>`).join("")}</tbody></table><aside class="comparison-insight">${e.comparisonInsights?.combinedMessage?`<p><strong>${u(e.comparisonInsights.combinedMessage)}</strong></p>`:""}<p>${u(e.comparisonInsights?.accuracyMessage||"Sem comparação de acerto disponível.")}</p><small>${u(e.comparisonInsights?.caveat||"A comparação é descritiva.")}</small></aside><p><strong>Alvos cadastrados:</strong> ${e.goals.targets.topicsWeekly??"—"} tópicos/semana · ${e.goals.targets.questionsWeekly??"—"} questões/semana · ${e.goals.targets.simulationsWeekly??"—"} simulados/semana · ${e.goals.targets.accuracy??"—"}% de acerto.</p><p>Registros no período: ${e.goals.observed.topicsCompleted} tópicos concluídos · ${e.goals.observed.questions} questões · ${e.goals.observed.simulations} simulados · ${$(e.goals.observed.accuracy==null?null:e.goals.observed.accuracy+"%")} de acerto.</p></section>
